      "text": "HTML: (HyperTextMarkupLanguage)\n1\nGB/T45508—2025\n对象表示法",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 29,
      "text": "JSON:JavaScript (JavaScriptObjectNotation)\n非结构化查询语言",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 30,
      "text": "NoSQL: (NotOnlyStructuredQueryLanguage)\n可移植文件格式",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 31,
      "text": "PDF: (PortableDocumentFormat)\n资源描述框架",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 25
    },
    {
